43:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50516550/michigan-hire-texas-trev-alberts-athletic-director","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on College Football Playoff bubble after the committee's third ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-18T03:42:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50503628/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-third-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the move? CFP committee's third top 25 and bracket of 2026","description":"A look at the new bracket based on the College Football Playoff committee's third set of rankings.","published":"2026-11-18T04:34:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514170/cfp-2026-third-committee-top-25-bracket","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Wake Forest surges into CFP top 12; top 4 unchanged while Texas jumps Notre Dame","description":"Alabama stayed at No. 3 despite some struggles on Saturday while two-loss Texas jumped one-loss Notre Dame for No. 5 in the CFP's latest rankings.","published":"2026-11-18T04:55:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50515993/wake-forest-surges-cfp-top-12-texas-jumps-notre-dame","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Pawn shop fighting 'Gold Digger' trademark filed by Jordon Hudson's company","description":"A California pawn shop is opposing a trademark application for \"Gold Digger\" filed by a company connected to Jordan Hudson, then-companion of Bill Belichick.","published":"2026-11-18T00:07:30.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/story/_/id/50514442/pawn-shop-fights-gold-digger-trademark-filed-hudson","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Anthony Olivieri","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Oklahoma coach Venables shouts out Love's after Buc-ee's comment","description":"Venables showed love Sunday to Buc-ee's -- which is owned by an alumnus of the Sooners' next opponent, Texas A&M. So on Tuesday the coach repped the Oklahoma-based Love's.","published":"2026-11-17T22:23:36.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513199/oklahoma-brent-venables-loves-travel-stop","type":"Story","byline":"J.J. Post","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-17T21:26:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"North Texas QB Tayven Jackson out with upper-body injury","description":"North Texas senior quarterback Tayven Jackson, who is sixth in the FBS with 3,005 passing yards, will miss at least the next two games with an upper-body injury.","published":"2026-11-17T20:53:17.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50513204/north-texas-qb-tayven-jackson-upper-body-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Defiant Dabo Swinney says Clemson's 'gonna win a bunch more'","description":"Despite going through a self-described \"rough patch\" over the past two seasons, Clemson coach Dabo Swinney is resolute in his belief that he and the Tigers have a lot more wins ahead of them.","published":"2026-11-17T20:37:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512833/defiant-dabo-swinney-says-clemson-gonna-win-bunch-more","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4905925/devan-thompkins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins"},"pick":{"pick":32,"round":1,"team":"BUF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Devan Thompkins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:29Z","intro":"Devan Thompkins is an American college football defensive tackle for the Alabama Crimson Tide. He previously played for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Thompkins attended St. Mary's High School in Stockton, California for three years before transferring to Edison High School in Stockton for his senior year. He played basketball at St. Mary's and did not play football until his senior year at Edison. He played defensive end and tight end in high school and had nine tackles and caught three passes for 24 yards. Thompkins committed to the University of Southern California (USC) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Thompkins played in three combined games his first two years at USC in 2022 and 2023. In 2024, he started six of 13 games and recorded 24 tackles and 1.5 sacks. In 2025, he had 31 tackles and three sacks. After the season, Thompkins entered the transfer portal."}]}}